comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-30T19:23:49.271Z",pi-agent,"Finding 3890282373 reproduced: source-only revert produced dynamic failure counts [1,1,0] rather than [1,1,1], SOURCE_ONLY_REVERT_EXIT=1. Restored code skips known value-taking and flag-only npm options before testing the first subcommand token; coverage also exercises no-subcommand and flag-only controls. Finding 3890282370 was measured on current source and rejected: scalar=null and the audit returned the expected unprovenanced failure. Full test, 100% coverage, docstring, release, and real workflow verification pass."
